<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 3mth BUBOR rate up, 1mth, 3mth flat.</title>
<headline>Hungary 3mth BUBOR rate up, 1mth, 3mth flat.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) edged up on Monday day for the three-month maturity and was steady for one and six months, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on its Reuters page.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 20.51 percent, unchanged, the three-month rate at 20.04 percent, up 0.01, and the six-month rate at 19.69, unchanged.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
